{"title":"Science books","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Science books</b> are broken down into several areas:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_books\" title=\"Biology books\">Biology books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_books\" title=\"Chemistry books\">Chemistry books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_Science_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Computer Science books\">Computer Science books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Earth_Science_books\" title=\"Earth Science books\">Earth Science books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Game_Theory_books\" title=\"Game Theory books\">Game Theory books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logic_books\" title=\"Logic books\">Logic books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_textbooks\" title=\"Math textbooks\">Math textbooks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_books\" title=\"Physics books\">Physics books</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_books&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_scholarships\" title=\"Science scholarships\">Science scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105959\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expa